msgid ""
"MISSION FAILED \n"
" - objectives cannot be completed.\n"
msgstr ""
"MISSION ECHOUEE \n"
" - objectifs inatteignables.\n"

#. "L_AME_057"
msgid "Critical mission personnel killed.\n"
msgstr "Personnel crucial tué.\n"

#. "L_AME_058"
msgid "Obtain ECM Mines.\n"
msgstr "Obtenir mines CME.\n"

#. "L_AME_059"
msgid "Dr. Caroll's\n"
msgstr "Dr. Caroll: \n"

#. "L_AME_060"
msgid "ECM Mine\n"
msgstr "Mine CME\n"

#. "L_AME_061"
msgid "An ECM Mine\n"
msgstr "Une Mine CME\n"

#. "L_AME_062"
msgid "Picked up an ECM Mine.\n"
msgstr "Mine CME obtenue.\n"

#. "L_AME_063"
msgid "Obtain Data Uplink.\n"
msgstr "Obtenir récepteur.\n"

#. "L_AME_064"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. "L_AME_065"
msgid "Data Uplink\n"
msgstr "Récepteur\n"

#. "L_AME_066"
msgid "A Data Uplink\n"
msgstr "Un récepteur\n"

#. "L_AME_067"
msgid "Picked up a Data Uplink.\n"
msgstr "Récepteur obtenu.\n"

#. "L_AME_068"
msgid ""
"Yes, yes, I agree. Personality is expendable\n"
" in this case.\n"
msgstr ""
"Oui, oui, je suis d'accord. On peut se passer\n"
" de sa personnalité.\n"

#. "L_AME_069"
msgid ""
"No, I can start the process from my office\n"
" terminal and delete the necessary files\n"
" at the same time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Non, je peux y travailler depuis mon ordinateur\n"
" de bureau et effacer les fichiers\n"
" en même temps.\n"

#. "L_AME_070"
msgid "I'll begin at once. Goodbye.\n"
msgstr "Je m'y mets tout de suite. Au revoir.\n"

#. "L_AME_071"
msgid "Move it!\n"
msgstr "Au pied!\n"

#. "L_AME_072"
msgid ""
"I've got a password problem, and you're \n"
"the man to help me with it.\n"
msgstr ""
"J'ai un problème de mot de passe, et vous \n"
"allez le résoudre.\n"

#. "L_AME_073"
msgid "Don't shoot, don't shoot!\n"
msgstr "Ne tirez pas! Ne tirez pas!\n"

#. "L_AME_074"
msgid "Datalink broken - connection terminated.\n"
msgstr "Transfert interrompu - connexion perdue.\n"

#. "L_AME_075"
msgid "Datalink error - incomplete file download.\n"
msgstr "Erreur transfert - téléchargement incomplet.\n"

#. "L_AME_076"
msgid "Internal security system temporarily disabled.\n"
msgstr "Système de sécurité temporairement annulé.\n"

#. "L_AME_077"
msgid "External communications hub disabled.\n"
msgstr "Communications extérieures coupées.\n"

#. "L_AME_078"
msgid "Laboratory lift located.\n"
msgstr "Ascenseur du laboratoire localisé.\n"

#. "L_AME_079"
msgid "Security... Help me!\n"
msgstr "Sécurité!!! A l'aide!\n"

#. "L_AME_080"
msgid "ECM Mine needed to disable security hub.\n"
msgstr "Mine CME requise pour brouiller sécurité.\n"

#. "L_AME_081"
msgid "ECM Mine needed to disable comms hub.\n"
msgstr "Mine CME requise pour brouiller coms.\n"

#. "L_AME_082"
msgid "Dummy\n"
msgstr "Leurre\n"

#. "L_AME_083"
msgid "How dare you disturb me!\n"
msgstr "Vous osez me déranger?\n"

#. "L_AME_084"
msgid "You will regret this intrusion, girl!\n"
msgstr "Vous allez le regretter, jeune fille!\n"

#. "L_AME_085"
msgid "If I were you, I'd leave...NOW!\n"
msgstr "Un conseil: partez...MAINTENANT!\n"

#. "L_AME_086"
msgid "Please don't kill me!\n"
msgstr "Ne me tuez pas!\n"

#. "L_AME_087"
msgid "Don't shoot!\n"
msgstr "Pitié!\n"

#. "L_AME_088"
msgid "Obtain CamSpy.\n"
msgstr "Obtenir CamSpy.\n"

#. "L_AME_089"
msgid "Dr. Caroll's\n"
msgstr "La CamSpy du\n"

#. "L_AME_090"
msgid "CamSpy\n"
msgstr "Dr. Caroll\n"

#. "L_AME_091"
msgid "A CamSpy\n"
msgstr "Une CamSpy\n"

#. "L_AME_092"
msgid "Picked up a CamSpy.\n"
msgstr "CamSpy obtenue.\n"

#. "L_AME_093"
msgid ""
"We're getting a positive reading - \n"
"the internal comms hub is nearby.\n"
msgstr ""
"Signal positif - \n"
"le relais de com intérieur est proche.\n"

#. "L_AME_094"
msgid ""
"You're on the same floor as \n"
"Cassandra's office.\n"
msgstr ""
"Le bureau de Cassandra est à \n"
"cet étage.\n"

#. "L_AME_095"
msgid ""
"The other hub has got to be in the \n"
"Security Room.\n"
msgstr ""
"L'autre relais doit être dans la \n"
"salle de surveillance.\n"

#. "L_AME_096"
msgid ""
"The basement elevator must be around \n"
"there somewhere.\n"
msgstr ""
"L'ascenseur souterrain doit être dans \n"
"le coin.\n"

#. "L_AME_097"
msgid "Security system is now back online.\n"
msgstr "Système de sécurité opérationnel.\n"

#. "L_AME_098"
msgid "You vandal, you've broken it!\n"
msgstr "Bravo...ça ne marche plus!\n"

#. "L_AME_099"
msgid "2023 AD, 2214 Hours  Lucerne Tower - dataDyne HQ\n"
msgstr "2023, H: 22:14 Tour Lucerne - QG dataDyne\n"

#. "L_AME_100"
msgid "Why the big hurry?\n"
msgstr "Pourquoi agir si vite?\n"

#. "L_AME_101"
msgid ""
"If Dr. Caroll is not extracted tonight, \n"
"dataDyne will put him through mind \n"
"conditioning, and we'll lose our best \n"
"chance of finding out what dataDyne \n"
"are up to.\n"
msgstr ""
"Si le Dr. Caroll n'est pas sauvé ce soir, \n"
"ses supérieurs conditionneront son \n"
"esprit et nous ne pourrons découvrir \n"
"les plans de la dataDyne. \n"

#. "L_AME_102"
msgid "Are they all expendable?\n"
msgstr "Peut-on les éliminer?\n"

#. "L_AME_103"
msgid ""
"Don't joke! You have to be careful, Joanna. \n"
"Code keys will only operate while the owner \n"
"is alive... If you kill them, the key is \n"
"useless. Armed guards are a different matter, \n"
"of course.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pas de bêtises: une clé de sécurité ne \n"
"fonctionne que si le détenteur est \n"
"en vie. Ne tuez donc pas n'importe \n"
"qui. Vous pouvez vous occuper des \n"
"gardes armés...\n"

#. "L_AME_104"
msgid "What's the target location?\n"
msgstr "Où se trouve la cible?\n"

#. "L_AME_105"
msgid ""
"Work your way down the building to the ground \n"
"level. Dr. Caroll will be in a research lab \n"
"somewhere in the underground facility.\n"
msgstr ""
"Descendez l'immeuble jusqu'aux niveaux \n"
"inférieurs. Le Dr. Caroll se trouve \n"
"dans un laboratoire souterrain.\n"

#. "L_AME_106"
msgid "How will I recognize him?\n"
msgstr "Comment le reconnaître?\n"

#. "L_AME_107"
msgid ""
"We don't have an image record, and we can't \n"
"find any official files. All we have is the \n"
"name. Good luck, Perfect Dark.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nous n'avons aucune photo, ni document \n"
"d'archive. Nous ne connaissons que \n"
"son nom. Bonne chance, Perfect Dark.\n"

#. "L_AME_108"
msgid "Right, I'm in...\n"
msgstr "OK. J'y suis...\n"

#. "L_AME_109"
msgid "I...I'm logging on now.\n"
msgstr "Je...Je me connecte.\n"
